hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15744","Abu al-Yaman narrated to us, he said: Shu'ayb informed us, from al-Zuhri, he said: Uqbah ibn Suwayd al-Ansari informed me, that he heard his father, and he was among the companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: We returned with the Prophet of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) from the battle of Khaybar, and when Uhud appeared to him, the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Allah is Greatest, a mountain that loves us and we love it."
